5
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:21,430
I deserve to be protected and appreciated.

6
00:01:21,430 --> 00:01:37,050
I hope that those of you who found it in your space to speak of me in such vitriol, though I've never brought it to you, I hope that you take time to do the self-exploration that you're suggesting that I do.

7
00:01:37,050 --> 00:01:43,990
And there are private apologies and thank yous and love and that is appreciated.

8
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:53,790
But it does sting that it's never as loud as the public cacophony, but they are happy to receive from me.

9
00:01:53,790 --> 00:01:59,170
Which says to me, Amanda, go where you are loved.

10
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:01,650
